Connect the OLED

ESP32 DEVKIT V1              1.3-INCH SH1106 OLED
----------------             -------------------
3.3V  ----------------------> VCC*
GND   ----------------------> GND
GPIO 21 (SDA) --------------> SDA
GPIO 22 (SCL) --------------> SCL

Connect the MAX30100 sensor
ESP32 DEVKIT V1              MAX30100 MODULE
----------------             ---------------
3.3V  ----------------------> VIN*
GND   ----------------------> GND
GPIO 21 (SDA) --------------> SDA
GPIO 22 (SCL) --------------> SCL
                              INT  -- Not connected
